cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AnnoTuneAgent: cluster-level cell-type annotation"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the software record below and pin
  the package version used in the analysis.
abstract: >-
  Collects a marker score and a name-model result for each cluster. A check
  rule keeps that name, replaces it, or drops it. The title is a dictionary
  name. The name model reads dictionary marker hits.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Zhao (李钊)"
    email: "leelieber@gmail.com"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9276-9129"
repository-code: "https://github.com/leelieber2025/AnnoTuneAgent"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.7
date-released: "2026-11-17"
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - RNA-seq
  - cell type annotation
  - marker genes
  - bioinformatics
